==Battleground==
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*30 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Corporal Weyland]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Ribbo]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns.

==Strategy==
If the Ribbos and Corporal Weylands keep warping/killing your units, [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer]] may be of use. It can break Ribbo/Weyland's barrier as well as deal consistent damage to them. It is also possible to stack them at the start of the level because of the Hippoes.

